  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2020-2026 Toyota Corolla\nNot for Hatchback Model\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: YITAMOTOR floor mats and cargo mats fit for Toyota Corolla 2026-2020, use State-of-the-art 3D laser scanning technology ensures the perfect custom fit for your car. Corolla floor liners are precisely tailored for your vehicle-specific floor carpets\nHigh Durability: These Floor mats made from TPE material, offer comfort and wear resistance; Flexible in extreme temperatures; Does not contain latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVC\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The 2026 Corolla all-weather floor mats with unique channels and raised edges trap liquids, debris, and dirt, keeping car and shoes clean; Built-in clips ensure a firm grip and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: YITAMOTOR floor mats and cargo mats simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; Cleaning up daily wear and tear off our Corolla car mats and cargo liner is a breeze\nPackage Contents: Our newly upgraded floor mats offer extensive coverage without interfering with your pedals, thereby enhancing safety. The package includes: 2 front floor mats & 1 rear floor liner & 1 cargo liner",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
